FB100351,CUS0041,ORD100001,RES002,BiryaniBox Guntur,Uber Eats Delivery,29 mins,1,"Unacceptable delivery delay from BiryaniBox Guntur! The order arrived 50 minutes late, taking over an hour and fifteen minutes in total. The delivery agent refused to answer phone calls while we waited anxiously. When the parcel finally arrived, the biryani was completely cold and the paper bag was soaked in spilled curry. Terrible delivery service that ruined our evening plans in Guntur.",2024-07-03,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100352,CUS0042,ORD100002,RES003,BiryaniBox Hyderabad,BiryaniBox Direct Agent,57 mins,4,"Zero waiting time on a busy Friday night at BiryaniBox Hyderabad! We were seated immediately upon arrival, and our order of Special Mutton Biryani was served piping hot within 10 minutes. The kitchen operates with incredible speed and efficiency in Hyderabad. Outstanding table turnover and kitchen management! Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Hyderabad remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-04-09,Swiggy,English
FB100353,CUS0043,ORD100003,RES004,BiryaniBox Visakhapatnam,,,3,"Impressed by the ultra-fast delvery service from biryaniiBox Visakhapatnam! The food arrived in just 22 minutes, well ahead of the estimated arrival time. The delvery partner was extremely polite, wore a clean uniform, and followed all drop-off instructions accurately. The packaging was piping hot and completely sealed with zero spillage. Seamless experience from app order placement to final delvery in Visakhapatnam.",2024-04-22,Swiggy,Telugu
FB100354,CUS0044,ORD100004,RES005,BiryaniBox Bengaluru,BiryaniBox Direct Agent,40 mins,1,"Stood outside in the heat for over 45 minutes despite pre-booking a table online! When we finally got seated, the kitchen took another 35 minutes to bring out two basic chicken biryanis. Unacceptable operational delays that test customer patience. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Bengaluru remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-02-27,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100355,CUS0045,ORD100005,RES006,BiryaniBox Chennai,Swiggy Express,31 mins,2,"Extremely poor value for money. The portion size delivered today was barely enough for one person despite paying for a 'Special Jumbo' pack. High prices combined with mediocre food quality make BiryaniBox Chennai uncompetitive compared to other top biryani spots in Chennai. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Chennai remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-01-24,Swiggy,English
FB100356,CUS0046,ORD100006,RES007,BiryaniBox Pune,Swiggy Express,46 mins,4,"<p>Prompt and swift table service! Even with a full dining room, the staff managed orders flawlessly. Starters arrived in 7 minutes and main course biryani was brought out right after. Smooth dining experience without tedious waiting. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Pune remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.</p>",2024-05-10,Swiggy,Telugu
FB100357,CUS0047,ORD100007,RES008,BiryaniBox Mumbai,,,1,"The BiryaniBox app is plagued with severe bugs! It crashed three times while selecting delivery address in Mumbai, resetting my cart contents repeatedly. When I attempted payment, the screen froze on a blank white box. Worst user experience on Android. Please release an urgent bug fix update! Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Mumbai remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-03-03,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100358,CUS0048,ORD100008,RES001,BiryaniBox Vijayawada,Uber Eats Delivery,47 mins,4,"Very reasonable pricing considering the premium basmati rice, high quality ingredients, and generous portion sizes. The executive lunch box is priced perfectly for working professionals in Vijayawada. Great combo offers and loyalty reward discounts make dining at BiryaniBox Vijayawada worth every single rupee spent. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Vijayawada remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-01-07,Swiggy,English
FB100359,CUS0049,ORD100009,RES002,BiryaniBox Guntur,Zomato Valet,35 mins,4,"Ordered dinner through the mobile app from the Guntur outlet. The Chicken 65 Biryani combo was absolutely delicious, brimming with authentic Hyderabadi flavor and freshly fried curry leaves. Basmati grains were long, separate, and fragrant. Packaging kept the meal piping hot until it reached our doorstep. It is rare to find such consistent quality across repeat orders. BiryaniBox has earned a loyal customer in me. 🤢🤮👎",2024-06-25,Swiggy,Telugu
FB100360,CUS0050,ORD100010,RES003,BiryaniBox Hyderabad,Zomato Valet,38 mins,3,"<div class=""review-box"">Payment went through on the second attempt after a minor 10-second gateway delay on the mobile app. OTP receipt took a few moments, but the order was confirmed successfully once processed. Standard payment experience overall. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Hyderabad remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.</div>",2024-06-08,Swiggy,Hindi
