FB100382,CUS0072,ORD100032,RES001,BiryaniBox Vijayawada,Zomato Valet,44 mins,3,"   Visited  BiryaniBox  Vijayawada  with  colleagues  for  lunch  and  ordered  the  Mutton  Fry  Piece  Biryani  along  with  Apollo  Fish.  The  meat  was  tender,  falling  off  the  bone  effortlesly,  and  the  ghee  flavor  in  the  rice  was  rich  without  feeling  excessively  heavy.  The  spices  were  perfectly  balanced,  satisfying  everyone  at  our  table.  The  starters  were  served  piping  hot  with  fresh  onion  rings  and  lemon  wedges.  Excellent  culinary  quality  and  great  value  for  money  in  the  Vijayawada  dining  scene.   ",2024-02-28,Swiggy,English
