FB100405,CUS0095,ORD100055,RES008,BiryaniBox Mumbai,Zomato Valet,51 mins,3,"The management at the Mumbai branch showed complete apathy when we pointed out a wrong item on our bill. Instead of rectifying the billing error politely, the cashier argued loudly. Shocking lack of basic hospitality training at BiryaniBox Mumbai. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Mumbai remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-04-24,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100406,CUS0096,ORD100056,RES001,BiryaniBox Vijayawada,BiryaniBox Direct Agent,47 mins,5,"Multiple payment options available including credit cards, debit cards, NetBanking, Paytm, and Amazon Pay. Checkout was effortless and instant OTP verification worked smoothly. Invoice was immediately sent to my registered email and phone number. Great fintech integration! Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Vijayawada remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-02-28,Swiggy,English
FB100407,CUS0097,ORD100057,RES002,BiryaniBox Guntur,BiryaniBox Direct Agent,60 mins,,"Hidden charges and inflated prices ruined our ordering experience. The app displayed a lower price initially, but added excessive surge charges, packaging fees, and delivery markups at checkout. Not worth the steep cost for average tasting biryani. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Guntur remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-05-23,Swiggy,Telugu
FB100408,CUS0098,ORD100058,RES003,BiryaniBox Hyderabad,Swiggy Express,60 mins,2,"   No  cutlery  or  napkins  were  included  despite  ticking  the  request  box  in  the  app.  The  curry  container  was  cracked  on  one  side,  allowing  oil  to  seep  through  the  paper  bag  onto  my  car  seat  during  pickup.  Careless  packaging  management  that  reflects  poor  attention  to  detail  at  BiryaniBox  Hyderabad.  Furthermore,  the  staff  hygiene  standards  and  overall  brand  consistency  at  BiryaniBox  Hyderabad  remain  commendable  across  repeat  visits.  We  look  forward  to  ordering  our  next  meal  here  soon.   ",22-Jun-2024,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100409,CUS0099,ORD100059,RES004,BiryaniBox Visakhapatnam,Uber Eats Delivery,42 mins,4,"Excellent queue management system using SMS notifications. We were given a token number and received an automated text when our table was ready in 8 minutes. Organized and hassle-free waiting experience at the Visakhapatnam location. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Visakhapatnam remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-05-27,Swiggy,English
FB100410,CUS0100,ORD100060,RES005,BiryaniBox Bengaluru,Zomato Valet,53 mins,5,"The new BiryaniBox mobile application is brilliant! Clean, modern UI with smooth category navigation and quick customization sliders for spice levels and extra salan. The live GPS rider tracking feature works with pinpoint accuracy. Ordering biryani in Bengaluru has never been easier or faster. Kudos to the tech development team!",2024-04-26,Swiggy,Telugu
FB100411,CUS0101,ORD100061,RES006,BiryaniBox Chennai,Swiggy Express,31 mins,1,"<div class=""review-box"">The management at the Chennai branch showed complete apathy when we pointed out a wrong item on our bill. Instead of rectifying the billing error politely, the cashier argued loudly. Shocking lack of basic hospitality training at BiryaniBox Chennai. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Chennai remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.</div>",2024-01-21,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100412,CUS0102,ORD100062,RES007,BiryaniBox Pune,Swiggy Express,30 mins,5,"The packaging quality from BiryaniBox Pune is top-class! They use sturdy, eco-friendly tin containers with tamper-evident seals that lock in the heat and aroma effectively. The salan and raita were sealed in thick spill-proof pouches, preventing any messy leaks inside the outer paper bag. Unboxing felt premium and hygienic. Very impressed with the attention to packaging detail in Pune.",2024-06-30,Swiggy,English
FB100413,CUS0103,ORD100063,RES008,BiryaniBox Mumbai,Zomato Valet,64 mins,1,"The chiken Dum biryanii delivered today from biryaniiBox Mumbai was dripping in excess oil, making the bottom layer of rice completely soggy. The spices tasted raw and unblended, causing severe stomach discomfort later in the evening. Quality has visibly declined at the Mumbai branch over recent months. I cannot recommend this place until strict quality standards are restored.",2024-04-30,Swiggy,Telugu
FB100414,CUS0104,ORD100064,RES001,BiryaniBox Vijayawada,Zomato Valet,55 mins,5,"We ordered the Hyderabadi Chicken Dum Biryani and Special Boneless Starter from the Vijayawada branch for a weekend family gathering. The aromatic basmati rice was cooked to perfection with rich ghee, cardamom, and authentic spices that elevated every bite. The chicken pieces were remarkably juicy and tender throughout. The mirchi ka salan and refreshing curd raita complemented the main dish beautifully. Portion size was very generous, easily satisfying our entire group. We will definitely order again soon.",2024-01-05,Swiggy,Hindi
FB100415,CUS0105,ORD100065,RES002,BiryaniBox Guntur,Zomato Valet,53 mins,3,"Excellent queue management system using SMS notifications. We were given a token number and received an automated text when our table was ready in 8 minutes. Organized and hassle-free waiting experience at the Guntur location. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Guntur remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",19/03/2024,Swiggy,English
