FB100417,CUS0107,ORD100067,RES004,BiryaniBox Visakhapatnam,Zomato Valet,33 mins,4,"Zero wating time on a busy Friday night at biryaniiBox Visakhapatnam! We were seated immediately upon arrival, and our order of Special Mutton biryanii was served piping hot within 10 minutes. The kitchen operates with incredible speed and efficiency in Visakhapatnam. Outstanding table turnover and kitchen management! Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at biryaniiBox Visakhapatnam remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-03-25,Swiggy,Hindi
