FB100457,CUS0147,ORD100107,RES004,BiryaniBox Visakhapatnam,Swiggy Express,25 mins,2,"Extremely poor delivery coordination. The rider assigned to our order got lost in Visakhapatnam and kept arguing over the phone instead of checking GPS directions. By the time he reached our location, the food was stone cold and unappetizing. Furthermore, the delivery partner was rude when handed payment. BiryaniBox must train their delivery personnel properly.",2024-01-08,Swiggy,English
