FB100467,CUS0157,ORD100117,RES006,BiryaniBox Chennai,Zomato Valet,36 mins,5,"Superb tamper-proof packaging that guarantees hygiene and fresh food delivery. The aluminum handi box preserved the ghee aroma of the biryani perfectly. Starter containers had steam vents to prevent moisture buildup, keeping the chicken crisp. Excellent packaging standards that other restaurants in Chennai should emulate. Furthermore, the staff hygiene standards and overall brand consistency at BiryaniBox Chennai remain commendable across repeat visits. We look forward to ordering our next meal here soon.",2024-04-29,Swiggy,Telugu
