FB100410,CUS0100,ORD100060,RES005,BiryaniBox Bengaluru,Zomato Valet,53 mins,5,"The new BiryaniBox mobile application is brilliant! Clean, modern UI with smooth category navigation and quick customization sliders for spice levels and extra salan. The live GPS rider tracking feature works with pinpoint accuracy. Ordering biryani in Bengaluru has never been easier or faster. Kudos to the tech development team! (Follow up note: Customer re-confirmed feedback via call)",2024-04-26,Swiggy,Telugu
