FB100414,CUS0104,ORD100064,RES001,BiryaniBox Vijayawada,Zomato Valet,55 mins,5,"We ordered the Hyderabadi Chicken Dum Biryani and Special Boneless Starter from the Vijayawada branch for a weekend family gathering. The aromatic basmati rice was cooked to perfection with rich ghee, cardamom, and authentic spices that elevated every bite. The chicken pieces were remarkably juicy and tender throughout. The mirchi ka salan and refreshing curd raita complemented the main dish beautifully. Portion size was very generous, easily satisfying our entire group. We will definitely order again soon. (Follow up note: Customer re-confirmed feedback via call)",2024-01-05,Swiggy,Hindi